*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0019
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 879
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0019.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 CREDIT-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
    05 DEBT-INC-RATIO     PIC 9V99.
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 APPL-DECISION      PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM DECIDE-APPLICATION
    DISPLAY "APPL-DECISION=" APPL-DECISION
    STOP RUN.
DECIDE-APPLICATION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 740 AND DEBT-INC-RATIO < 0.43
            MOVE 'A' TO APPL-DECISION
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 640
            MOVE 'R' TO APPL-DECISION
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'D' TO APPL-DECISION
    END-EVALUATE.
